{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859430/extras/df4640b47b98d0d171f7ec877739c690.avif?t=1773965771\" width=616 height=190 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A roguelite action game set in a post-apocalyptic water world. Shape your strategy by choosing which abilities shine by day and which awaken at night.<br>Get ready for fast-paced combat, procedural generation, permadeath, and meta-progression.<br>You play as a volunteer sent to the surface in search of vital resources. Explore rust-covered platforms, fight hostile machines, collect loot, and upgrade your skills. Maybe your run will be the one that changes everything - and gives humanity a second chance. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859430/extras/9de9fdfe679650dac00515be0d7c98d0.poster.avif?t=1773965771\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859430/extras/9de9fdfe679650dac00515be0d7c98d0.webm?t=1773965771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859430/extras/9de9fdfe679650dac00515be0d7c98d0.mp4?t=1773965771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >High-Intensity Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies are deadly and unforgiving. You'll need precise aim and constant movement to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Day-Night Cycle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some perks only work during the day, others - only at night. Plan your build wisely as time in the game moves forward relentlessly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Wide Arsenal of Weapons and Gadgets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match dozens of weapons and active items to handle any threat that comes your way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Procedural Generation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels, enemies, and loot are generated from scratch each time - no two runs are the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meta-Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is not the end. Upgrade your starting base to improve your chances in future runs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Post-Apocalyptic Waterworld</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Civilization fell in a war against soulless machines. Cities are submerged, and the last survivors hide in underwater bunkers, venturing to the surface only in search of resources.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3859430?t=1773965771","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859430/27a7effff7a185d098f0f7fb4aa16e27df509afe/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773965771","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859430/f25d9c016e22622dfdedbb6004f6310369fe7a7e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773965771","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859430/f25d9c016e22622dfdedbb6004f6310369fe7a7e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773965771","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4325190,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859430/extras/df4640b47b98d0d171f7ec877739c690.avif?t=1773965771\" width=616 height=190 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A roguelite action game set in a post-apocalyptic water world. Shape your strategy by choosing which abilities shine by day and which awaken at night.<br>Get ready for fast-paced combat, procedural generation, permadeath, and meta-progression.<br>You play as a volunteer sent to the surface in search of vital resources. Explore rust-covered platforms, fight hostile machines, collect loot, and upgrade your skills. Maybe your run will be the one that changes everything - and gives humanity a second chance. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859430/extras/9de9fdfe679650dac00515be0d7c98d0.poster.avif?t=1773965771\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859430/extras/9de9fdfe679650dac00515be0d7c98d0.webm?t=1773965771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859430/extras/9de9fdfe679650dac00515be0d7c98d0.mp4?t=1773965771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >High-Intensity Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies are deadly and unforgiving. You'll need precise aim and constant movement to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Day-Night Cycle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some perks only work during the day, others - only at night. Plan your build wisely as time in the game moves forward relentlessly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Wide Arsenal of Weapons and Gadgets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match dozens of weapons and active items to handle any threat that comes your way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Procedural Generation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels, enemies, and loot are generated from scratch each time - no two runs are the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meta-Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is not the end. Upgrade your starting base to improve your chances in future runs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Post-Apocalyptic Waterworld</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Civilization fell in a war against soulless machines. Cities are submerged, and the last survivors hide in underwater bunkers, venturing to the surface only in search of resources.</p>","developers":["R_Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859430/5febb63b4d2cab74e64ec5790181b627a8e72349/header.jpg?t=1773965771","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2048 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 512 MB graphics card with WebGL support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3859430/125657778/6a53becbfee86017828a876ad1a0746b7d569c12/1769726778/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769728912","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3859430/125657778/6a53becbfee86017828a876ad1a0746b7d569c12/1769726778/dash_h264.mpd?t=1769728912","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3859430/125657778/6a53becbfee86017828a876ad1a0746b7d569c12/1769726778/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1769728912","id":257274272,"name":"New Gameplay trailer 2026","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257274272/8202727a8caf624c1af2b4b22c030d62378afd08/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1769728912"}],"name":"Waterpunk: Through the Rust","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or newer (x64)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2048 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 512 MB graphics card with WebGL support<br></li